# Title: Raccine Uninstall
# ID: a31eeaed-3fd5-478e-a8ba-e62c6b3f9ecc
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2021-01-21
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
# Description: Detects commands that indicate a Raccine removal from an end system. Raccine is a free ransomware protection tool.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((CommandLine CONTAIN "taskkill " AND CommandLine CONTAIN "RaccineSettings.exe")) OR ((CommandLine CONTAIN "reg.exe" AND CommandLine CONTAIN "delete" AND CommandLine CONTAIN "Raccine Tray")) OR ((CommandLine CONTAIN "schtasks" AND CommandLine CONTAIN "/DELETE" AND CommandLine CONTAIN "Raccine Rules Updater")))
